    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been noticing some small, irregular holes appearing in the leaves of my tomato plants in the greenhouse. it's not an entire leaf being eaten, just tiny spots. any idea what might be causing this? we haven't seen many bugs lately but the damage is spreading.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
