      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip about the water spray. it's just really frustrating because i feel like we're watching them 24/7 and yet they just seem to sneak in and do damage when we aren't looking. it's almost like they know exactly when to show up. is there anything else besides pests that could cause damage that's just \"stealthy\" like that? like something that could happen without any obvious sign of being there?",
